  "id": "9e756564-15a6-455e-a39f-59be9592f5a8",
  "title": "Celestial Priest",
  "description": "[overview]\nLive, laugh, love Lunar Eclipse -> Moonflow\n\nRotate Celestial Form and Starshatter between each pack depending on the tank to burst heal everyone, and get full mana with Eclipse -> Moonflow. \n\nAlternatively you can go Moonlit Lancer instead of Lunar Anomaly (the talent above Starshatter) that turns Lunar Lance into a DoT and tab target full stacks of that onto everything.",
