  {
   "id": "318d62ca-1907-4d56-890d-156485b1c377",
   "build_id": "9e756564-15a6-455e-a39f-59be9592f5a8",
   "author_id": "20d0cd1c-d8c2-4bc4-9de1-d02a3bafc106",
   "parent_id": "7dcc86d9-d81b-4b18-bdce-6919760ca1cc",
   "body": "You could take it, but it's fairly niche. How often are you getting hit by mobs in melee ? \n\nCombining: Warden's Blade + Glaive Tossing + New Moon + Blessed by the Stars you can use Warden's Blade as a way to move and hopefully generate a Scattered Star stack.",
